{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1560","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"丞相祠堂何处寻？锦官城外柏森森。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"映阶碧草自春色，隔叶黄鹂空好音。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"三顾频烦天下计，两朝开","type":"text"},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://www.zdic.net/hans/%E6%BF%9F","sourceUrl":"https://www.zdic.net/hans/%E6%BF%9F","text":"济","type":"link"},{"text":"老臣心。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"出师未捷身先死，长使英雄泪满襟。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔丞相祠堂〕即诸葛武侯祠。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔映阶碧草自春色，隔叶黄鹂空好音〕遮着台阶的青草自绿，树上黄鹂徒然发出好听的声音。映，遮蔽。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔三顾频烦天下计〕指刘备为统一天下三顾茅庐，问计于诸葛亮。频烦， 即频繁。一说多次烦劳咨询。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔两朝开济〕指诸葛亮辅助刘备开创帝业，后又辅佐刘禅。开，开创。","type":"text"},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://www.zdic.net/hans/%E6%BF%9F","sourceUrl":"https://www.zdic.net/hans/%E6%BF%9F","text":"济","type":"link"},{"text":"，扶助。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔出师未捷身先死〕指诸葛亮出师伐魏，未能取胜，于蜀汉建兴十二年（234）病死于五丈原（今陕西岐山东南）军中。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"runs":[{"alt":"This is","mediaId":"media-aed30b7b12c7cc63e123","type":"media-ref"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://ctext.org/library.pl?if=gb&file=56722&page=49","provider":"ctext","sourceUrl":"https://ctext.org/library.pl?if=gb&file=56722&page=49","text":"開啟中國哲學書電子化計劃原文","type":"resource-link"},{"runs":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/kSx7jox28Mk5wywaCuiSBLHm9WX.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/kSx7jox28Mk5wywaCuiSBLHm9WX.pdf","text":"蜀相-中国古典文学基本丛书.杜诗详注.清仇占鳌.中华书局.1979.pdf","type":"link"},{"text":" (260.8 KB)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"唐诗是中华民族宝贵的文化遗产，李白、杜甫是两位具有代表性的伟大诗人。李白擅长古体诗；杜甫诸体皆擅，在律诗方面成就尤高。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"《蜀道难》是杂言古体诗，格律不拘，形式灵活。这首诗想象奇特，笔意纵横，境界阔大，集中体现了李白诗歌豪放飘逸的创作特点。诵读时，一方面要感受杂言古体诗的参差错落之美，另一方面要想象作者笔下蜀道的雄奇险峻，体会李白诗歌的浪漫主义风格。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"《蜀相》是七言律诗，结构严整，法度森然。这首诗抒写作者游览武侯祠的所见所感，表达了对诸葛亮才干、德行的称颂及对其“出师未捷身先死”的惋惜，也暗含着感时忧国的情怀和以身许国的抱负。全诗情感深沉悲壮，有厚重的历史感。学习时要反复诵读涵泳，并联系《出师表》等文，加深对诗人情志的理解。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"背诵课文。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《杜诗详注》卷九（中华书局2015 年版）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"这首诗作于唐肃宗上元元年（760）春，当时诗人初至成都，曾游武侯祠。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"蜀相，指诸葛亮，蜀汉丞相，封武乡侯。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://ctext.org/library.pl?if=gb&file=56722&page=49","sourceUrl":"https://ctext.org/library.pl?if=gb&file=56722&page=49","text":"開啟中國哲學書電子化計劃原文","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/kSx7jox28Mk5wywaCuiSBLHm9WX.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/kSx7jox28Mk5wywaCuiSBLHm9WX.pdf","text":"蜀相-中国古典文学基本丛书.杜诗详注.清仇占鳌.中华书局.1979.pdf","title":null},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e8%9c%80%e7%9b%b8-%e6%9d%9c%e7%94%ab","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e8%9c%80%e7%9b%b8-%e6%9d%9c%e7%94%ab","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e8%9c%80%e7%9b%b8-%e6%9d%9c%e7%94%ab","title":null},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://www.zdic.net/hans/%E6%BF%9F","sourceUrl":"https://www.zdic.net/hans/%E6%BF%9F","text":"济","title":null}],